@startuml feature-nearest-station-weather-flow
title Nearest Station Weather Feature Flow

actor User
participant "Dashboard" as Dashboard
participant "App" as App

User -> Dashboard: Choose map position or enter coordinates

Dashboard -> App: Request weather data for selected position and fixed date range

alt Station list missing or stale
  App -> App: Refresh available weather stations
end

App -> App: Find nearest weather station
App -> App: Get weather data for nearest station and fixed date range

alt Weather data found
  App --> Dashboard: Return weather data
  Dashboard --> User: Show charts and weather details
else Weather data unavailable
  App --> Dashboard: Return error or empty result
  Dashboard --> User: Show error or empty state
end

@enduml